  "从完整性、一致性与异常分布检查数据质量，识别影响建模和验证的关键问题。结合应用需求清洗、复核数据，减少缺失、异常及口径差异对实验判断的干扰。": "Examine data completeness, consistency and anomalies to identify issues affecting modeling and validation. Clean and review data against application needs, reducing the influence of missing values, anomalies and inconsistent definitions on experimental conclusions.",
