  "设计模型对照，分析预测误差、稳定性及不同数据条件下的表现。识别方法的优势、局限与待验证假设，为数据处理、模型调整和后续技术选择建立清晰依据。": "Compare models and analyze predictive error, stability and performance across data conditions. Identify strengths, limitations and hypotheses to test, providing a clear basis for data processing, model refinement and subsequent technical decisions.",
