  "面向手术视频的视觉语言检索。": "Vision–language retrieval for surgical video.",
  "作为 SurgClip 第一作者，我研究通用视觉语言表示如何适应手术视频。工作连接关键帧与阶段文本索引、轻量适配器训练、检索评估和结果可视化，并通过 INT8 量化与 PQ 压缩实验，分析匹配质量、存储收益和运行开销之间的取舍。": "As the first author of SurgClip, I investigate how general-purpose vision–language representations adapt to surgical video. My work connects keyframe–phase indexing, lightweight adapter training, retrieval evaluation and visualization. INT8 quantization and PQ compression experiments examine trade-offs in matching quality, storage and runtime.",
  "SurgClip 研究轻量领域适配如何改善手术关键帧与阶段文本的匹配，在明确的评估范围内分析通用视觉语言模型的适应能力。": "SurgClip investigates how lightweight domain adaptation improves matching between surgical keyframes and phase descriptions, examining the adaptability of general-purpose vision–language models within a clearly defined evaluation scope.",
  "手术阶段之间共享器械、组织与动作，细微的视觉差异增加了文本匹配的难度。SurgClip 在 CLIP 特征之上训练轻量阶段适配器，以基础模型为对照，检验领域信息能否改善关键帧与阶段描述的对应关系。": "Surgical phases share instruments, anatomy and actions, making subtle visual distinctions difficult to match with text. SurgClip trains a lightweight phase adapter on CLIP features, using the baseline model to test whether domain information improves alignment between keyframes and phase descriptions.",
  "我的工作覆盖视频抽帧、标注索引、适配器训练、检索评估与结果可视化。领域适配、INT8 量化和 PQ 向量压缩采用独立对照，分别衡量匹配质量、适配器文件体积、向量存储与运行代价，使每项结论对应其具体实验设置。": "My work spans video frame extraction, annotation indexing, adapter training, retrieval evaluation and visualization. Separate comparisons of domain adaptation, INT8 quantization and PQ embedding compression measure matching quality, adapter file size, embedding storage and runtime costs, tying each conclusion to its experimental setting.",
